    "kind": "claude-trace", "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons/d3b9234dd56f3af5862f06741f0dce101193b3df/png/claude-ai.png"}'
- name: Probe-Google
  title: Google 连通检测
  content: 等待检测；更新后请刷新
  icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons/d3b9234dd56f3af5862f06741f0dce101193b3df/png/google.png
  collapsed: true
  interval: 21600
  url: https://www.google.com
