    "服务-Google", "kind": "http", "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons/d3b9234dd56f3af5862f06741f0dce101193b3df/png/google.png",
    "expectedStatus": 204}'
- name: Probe-YouTube
  title: YouTube Premium页
